      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;How to combine the holy trinity of Free Java? Freedom, Compatibility and Community.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Java is Free! Now how do we keep it that way? How do we measure compatibity? What about this mysterious and non-free JCK? What is the future of the JCP process? Where does the community come in and how can you help?&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA; </description>
